cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: EEG Spikes
abstract: 'Detects interictal epileptiform discharges (spikes) on clinical scalp EEG with the Janca et al. 2015 (or Barkmeier et al. 2012) detector from epycom, both developed and validated on intracranial EEG, on the longitudinal bipolar montage; writes spikes, per-channel rates, multi-channel spike events with their leading channel, lateralisation and rates per sleep stage, leaving seizures and bad segments out.'
